  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Bank SME and Gender Financing Partnership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this transaction is to increase access to financing for small and medium enterprises (&#x201c;SMEs&#x201d;) and female retail clients in Panama, by creating and implementing a holistic value proposition which will support the growth of Global Bank&#x2019;s women and SME portfolios. To do this, IDB Invest is proposing a Senior Unsecured Loan of approximately US$ 160 million to Global Bank Corporation (&#x201c;Global Bank&#x201d; or &#x201c;GBC&#x201d;) comprised by (i) A Loan of up to US$60 million to be funded by IDB Invest; and (ii) IDB Invest B Loan expected to be of approximately US$100 million, to be funded through the sale of participations to commercial lenders (the &#x201c;Project&#x201d;). The term of the IDB Invest A Loan is up to four years, including one year of grace.</narrative>
  </description>
